Plugin I/O, part three: files the user picked.

Capabilities::grant_read(path) makes a path the user picked readable: a file
alone, a directory as a read root. Resolved when picked, so a link swapped in
for the pick later moves nothing. Shared by every clone of the grant and left
out of its Debug, so a host comparing grants does not see a pick.

